(4791004, 693245, 83650, '<td valign="top">Love the selective desat, but the bulb is blown out with the rings blending into one another.  I think it would have been pretty cool if you could have managed to show the entire apple.  As it is, I think we can guess the apple is hollowed out with the power leads going off into the darkness.  No vote, I''m in this one.</td>', 'Love the selective desat, but the bulb is blown out with the rings blending into one another.  I think it would have been pretty cool if you could have managed to show the entire apple.  As it is, I think we can guess the apple is hollowed out with the power leads going off into the darkness.  No vote, I''m in this one.', '2008-06-30 03:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
