(4791959, 693129, 92539, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually keen on heavy HDR stuff, but something about this is really nice. It has a certain silkiness to it.</td>', 'I''m not usually keen on heavy HDR stuff, but something about this is really nice. It has a certain silkiness to it.', '2008-06-30 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4791971, 693278, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but it seems a tad undersaturated</td>', 'Very nice, but it seems a tad undersaturated', '2008-06-30 17:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792136, 693129, 74333, '<td valign="top">amazing shot! i love the clarity</td>', 'amazing shot! i love the clarity', '2008-06-30 18:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792156, 693250, 55822, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.</td>', 'Very cool shot.', '2008-06-30 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792164, 692954, 55822, '<td valign="top">Very clean and well lit shot. Great detail in the glass and wires really stand out in this. Good job.</td>', 'Very clean and well lit shot. Great detail in the glass and wires really stand out in this. Good job.', '2008-06-30 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792288, 693197, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition and focus on the subect could be a stronger, but this is a superb concept and the shallow DOF is great. It also appears to be a little dark on my screen.</td>', 'The composition and focus on the subect could be a stronger, but this is a superb concept and the shallow DOF is great. It also appears to be a little dark on my screen.', '2008-06-30 20:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792291, 692756, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well done! I tried to do a similar shot and just couldn''t get it to work out.</td>', 'Well done! I tried to do a similar shot and just couldn''t get it to work out.', '2008-06-30 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792292, 693265, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very neat! Lovely, lovely tones!</td>', 'Very neat! Lovely, lovely tones!', '2008-06-30 20:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792296, 693307, 63269, '<td valign="top">On my screen this has a yellowish cast and looks a little dull. Perhaps the white balance was off? More contrast might help. I would suggest checking the "levels" on this image, to make sure that the highlights of this iamge are pure white. Also, I personally might try to make the ligbtblub a tad brighter. But otherwise this is a superbly contstructed image - excellent work!</td>', 'On my screen this has a yellowish cast and looks a little dull. Perhaps the white balance was off? More contrast might help. I would suggest checking the "levels" on this image, to make sure that the highlights of this iamge are pure white. Also, I personally might try to make the ligbtblub a tad brighter. But otherwise this is a superbly contstructed image - excellent work!', '2008-06-30 20:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792297, 692746, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and colors.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and colors.', '2008-06-30 20:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792301, 692924, 63269, '<td valign="top">Personally I think the colors are a little too harsh. Maybe a less busy background with more neutral colors might look better...Interesting idea though!</td>', 'Personally I think the colors are a little too harsh. Maybe a less busy background with more neutral colors might look better...Interesting idea though!', '2008-06-30 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792310, 693005, 63269, '<td valign="top">Just an idea... to really enforce the idea of "natural" light, you might try to get a truely "natural" reflection on the blub, i.e. without man-made buildings. This is a nicely done image though!</td>', 'Just an idea... to really enforce the idea of "natural" light, you might try to get a truely "natural" reflection on the blub, i.e. without man-made buildings. This is a nicely done image though!', '2008-06-30 20:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792317, 693310, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t terribly strong, but the lighting and oclros are very nice!</td>', 'The composition isn''t terribly strong, but the lighting and oclros are very nice!', '2008-06-30 20:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792321, 693312, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea! Personally, I think that a less shallow DOF might work better here. Normally I love shallow DOF, but here I think that it would help the image out if the lightbulb was in perfect focus. It takes a second for the viewer to realize the red blob is a lightbulb. Otherwise, this is an awesome photograph.</td>', 'Awesome idea! Personally, I think that a less shallow DOF might work better here. Normally I love shallow DOF, but here I think that it would help the image out if the lightbulb was in perfect focus. It takes a second for the viewer to realize the red blob is a lightbulb. Otherwise, this is an awesome photograph.', '2008-06-30 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792323, 692999, 77196, '<td valign="top">This should be labeled - Do NOT try this at home!</td>', 'This should be labeled - Do NOT try this at home!', '2008-06-30 20:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792325, 693187, 63269, '<td valign="top">A nice sharp, clean image.</td>', 'A nice sharp, clean image.', '2008-06-30 20:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792335, 692755, 63269, '<td valign="top">Personally I think if the shilhouette were of the profile of the face instead, the might have made the concept clearer. Also the cropping is a bit tight on the top; the lightbulb is almost cut off. Otherwise this is good image. I like the colors!</td>', 'Personally I think if the shilhouette were of the profile of the face instead, the might have made the concept clearer. Also the cropping is a bit tight on the top; the lightbulb is almost cut off. Otherwise this is good image. I like the colors!', '2008-06-30 21:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792337, 693185, 63269, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light! Bravo!</td>', 'Wonderful use of light! Bravo!', '2008-06-30 21:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792344, 692828, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMHO, the composition could be just a bit stronger, and it might also be nice if the lightblub were in focus. just a thought. The image is nicely lit though. Good work.</td>', 'IMHO, the composition could be just a bit stronger, and it might also be nice if the lightblub were in focus. just a thought. The image is nicely lit though. Good work.', '2008-06-30 21:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792349, 692959, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat idea! The highlights on the metal part of the blub are a little blown out, but otherwise this is good.</td>', 'Neat idea! The highlights on the metal part of the blub are a little blown out, but otherwise this is good.', '2008-06-30 21:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792364, 693325, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract bulb.</td>', 'Nice abstract bulb.', '2008-06-30 21:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792365, 692949, 63269, '<td valign="top">Ahh! finally. :) So far most of the images that have nothing but a simple light-bulb for a subject, like this, have been pretty boring. This however, is well-done; the vibrant color adds a great deal of interest. Excellent work.</td>', 'Ahh! finally. :) So far most of the images that have nothing but a simple light-bulb for a subject, like this, have been pretty boring. This however, is well-done; the vibrant color adds a great deal of interest. Excellent work.', '2008-06-30 21:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4792409, 693099, 14369, '<td valign="top">very different... 7</td>', 'very different... 7', '2008-06-30 21:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
