(4798398, 693129, 87863, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful!<br/> <br/>Very nicely done post processing.</td>', 'Very, very beautiful! Very nicely done post processing.', '2008-07-02 13:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798413, 693169, 63269, '<td valign="top">Intersting use of lighting... you''ve given this image an "antique" feel. :)</td>', 'Intersting use of lighting... you''ve given this image an "antique" feel. :)', '2008-07-02 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798430, 693287, 63269, '<td valign="top">Something that might help this photo out a bit would be to fix the lighting. Although everything is nicely exposed and focused, the lighting is rather flat and boring. You might want to try having the light come from several different sources, or better yet stick with natural lighting from a window or something. Just a thought - hope this helps! :)</td>', 'Something that might help this photo out a bit would be to fix the lighting. Although everything is nicely exposed and focused, the lighting is rather flat and boring. You might want to try having the light come from several different sources, or better yet stick with natural lighting from a window or something. Just a thought - hope this helps! :)', '2008-07-02 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798432, 692924, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the background and the old time feel of this.</td>', 'I like the background and the old time feel of this.', '2008-07-02 13:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798435, 693184, 63269, '<td valign="top">You might want to work on the composition some more to make this a more interesting photo. Nice colors though!</td>', 'You might want to work on the composition some more to make this a more interesting photo. Nice colors though!', '2008-07-02 13:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798442, 693325, 34192, '<td valign="top">hmmm.  not sure I see the relationship here.</td>', 'hmmm.  not sure I see the relationship here.', '2008-07-02 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798445, 693260, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, the green color is very interesting and the composition is excellent. But the subject isn''t very clear, and it''s difficult to make out what exactly everything is. Just my opinion. Perhaps you meant this to be an abstract photo.</td>', 'Well, the green color is very interesting and the composition is excellent. But the subject isn''t very clear, and it''s difficult to make out what exactly everything is. Just my opinion. Perhaps you meant this to be an abstract photo.', '2008-07-02 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798449, 692794, 34192, '<td valign="top">don''t get the significance but the image is well taken.</td>', 'don''t get the significance but the image is well taken.', '2008-07-02 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798452, 693324, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is maybe just a tad too dark. Normally I love dark, low-key photos, but here it didn''t work so well, since I couldn''t figure out what the subject was at first. Your use of the lighting is very good though. The exposure just needs to be a bit brighter.  Neat photo!</td>', 'This is maybe just a tad too dark. Normally I love dark, low-key photos, but here it didn''t work so well, since I couldn''t figure out what the subject was at first. Your use of the lighting is very good though. The exposure just needs to be a bit brighter.  Neat photo!', '2008-07-02 13:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798456, 693214, 63269, '<td valign="top">:) Very good photo - the composition might be a little weak, but I like the nice stark contrast and your concept is very clever.</td>', ':) Very good photo - the composition might be a little weak, but I like the nice stark contrast and your concept is very clever.', '2008-07-02 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
