(4798463, 693297, 34192, '<td valign="top">great concept, execution a little flawed, resulting photograph great.  Would be better if water had been filled to top so we couldn''t see line, thereby showing how it was done.  Never let the audience see how you do your tricks.  Post processing excellent though. 7 bump to 8 after viewing all.</td>', 'great concept, execution a little flawed, resulting photograph great.  Would be better if water had been filled to top so we couldn''t see line, thereby showing how it was done.  Never let the audience see how you do your tricks.  Post processing excellent though. 7 bump to 8 after viewing all.', '2008-07-02 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
