(4799485, 693044, 62187, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the bunch. I gave it a 10 and hope it''s a ribbon winner.  There is something about the soft glow that is very appealing against the black background. The composition is perfect as well as the subtle frame.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the bunch. I gave it a 10 and hope it''s a ribbon winner.  There is something about the soft glow that is very appealing against the black background. The composition is perfect as well as the subtle frame.', '2008-07-02 19:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799492, 693269, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this photo a 10. I really like the softness and colors. The one bad thing I''ll ignore that I think will bother some viewers is the choice of frame.</td>', 'I''m giving this photo a 10. I really like the softness and colors. The one bad thing I''ll ignore that I think will bother some viewers is the choice of frame.', '2008-07-02 19:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4799621, 693325, 81362, '<td valign="top">Having a bright boulder front and center takes away from the main subject of the image. Getting a bit closer might eliminate the bright rock, display more of the waterfall advantageously, and allow the green leaves framing it to take less room and have a more subdued role. It probably is a wonderful place, but having this in the Light Bulb challenge looks like a mistake (if so, please accept my sympathy -- it would be nice to have a way for the site council to approve withdrawal of such mistakes; if not an error, I''ll be interested in learning the connection to the topic).</td>', 'Having a bright boulder front and center takes away from the main subject of the image. Getting a bit closer might eliminate the bright rock, display more of the waterfall advantageously, and allow the green leaves framing it to take less room and have a more subdued role. It probably is a wonderful place, but having this in the Light Bulb challenge looks like a mistake (if so, please accept my sympathy -- it would be nice to have a way for the site council to approve withdrawal of such mistakes; if not an error, I''ll be interested in learning the connection to the topic).', '2008-07-02 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
