(4803819, 693044, 32872, '<td valign="top">Oh I really like this.  It reminds me of the old masters style of lighting :)<br/> <br/>Nice concept, very well-executed, plus the dirt adds to the feeling of working.</td>', 'Oh I really like this.  It reminds me of the old masters style of lighting :) Nice concept, very well-executed, plus the dirt adds to the feeling of working.', '2008-07-05 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
