(4803822, 693260, 32872, '<td valign="top">Somehow this ends up looking like abstract art of which I''m a HUGE fan...so I love your image and how you processed it!!!  Very original.  Nice cropping, too.</td>', 'Somehow this ends up looking like abstract art of which I''m a HUGE fan...so I love your image and how you processed it!!!  Very original.  Nice cropping, too.', '2008-07-05 03:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
