(4809476, 692954, 63503, '<td valign="top">Hello again Rembrandt, I had heard of your talent for taking portraits of people; I think you don''t do too bad in the ''drops of water'' and ''broken light bulbs'' departments either. Congatulations on this ribbon and the hundreds yet to come.</td>', 'Hello again Rembrandt, I had heard of your talent for taking portraits of people; I think you don''t do too bad in the ''drops of water'' and ''broken light bulbs'' departments either. Congatulations on this ribbon and the hundreds yet to come.', '2008-07-07 16:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
